WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,180
I really don’t want to consider giving it a try.

2
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:03,350
Thank you for the help

3
00:00:03,910 --> 00:00:05,790
Come often

4
00:00:05,790 --> 00:00:10,650
I've already called you next time you call me.

5
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:23,820
Let's change the branch next time. Wen Chen will come back if he has time. What happened to the non-Nanzhou branch? Let's talk about it later.

6
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:26,850
What happened started ten days ago

7
00:00:27,010 --> 00:00:28,530
Vulnerabilities suddenly appeared frequently in Nanjing District 2

8
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:31,130
As of today, there are 132 places that we have been patching up.

9
00:00:31,250 --> 00:00:36,330
But the frequency is so abnormal that there are not even twenty people who can fix it. If this continues, we will be overwhelmed first before the module comes in.

10
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:43,870
Go to the place where the recent loopholes have appeared. Qi Xuan is me. I am Xu Xinghui.

11
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:47,900
I’ve seen your presentation and we’ll have a chat later, Mr. Xu.

12
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:54,070
You should be able to learn a lot. Hello, this is Uncle Ning Yan.
